docs for the original App

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:17.310
Engine Task Queues as
well as Cloud Tasks?

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:18.870
WESLEY: Rest assured, my friend.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:21.780
Links to both of those
are also down below.

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:23.610
MARTIN: Sounds good.

